          </p>

          <p>
            At the brand's list price of about $70 for a 25-serving jar, the whey isolate costs roughly $2.80 per scoop and about $3.50 per 25 g of protein. The 25 percent subscription discount brings that to about $2.10 per scoop, or roughly $2.60 per 25 g. Those are approximate figures at the time of writing and will move with sales and retailer pricing.
