          </p>

          <p>
            If you take one shake a day, the difference between Momentous on subscription and a mid-priced certified isolate is perhaps $15 to $20 a month. For a drug-tested athlete that is trivial. For a recreational lifter on a budget it is the cost of a second tub of something else every few months, which is why we would not recommend Momentous to that buyer. Our <a href="/how-much-protein-do-i-need/">protein calculator guide</a> helps you work out how many shakes you actually need before you commit to a premium tub.
          </p>
